    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <nav aria-label="Table of Contents">
        <div class="toc-heading">In This Article</div>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#what-are-nlgi-grades" target="_top">What Are NLGI Grease Grades?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#thickener-chemistry" target="_top">Thickener Chemistry &amp; Types</a></li>
